flowchart TD
    A([runPhotoForensics\ncalled]) --> B[Phase 1: Metadata Analysis\nextractExifMetadata\nGPS coordinates\ntimestamp consistency\ndevice fingerprint]

    B --> C[Phase 1: Pixel Analysis\ndetectSpliceArtifacts\ndetectCompressionAnomalies\ndetectCloneRegions\ndetectBrightnessManipulation]

    C --> D[Phase 1: Forensic Score\nweighted sum of\nall pixel signals\nmetadata anomalies]

    D --> E{Phase 1 score\nabove PHASE2_TRIGGER?}

    E -- Yes --> F[Phase 2: LLM Deep Analysis\nGPT-4o vision\nfocused forensic prompt\nmanipulation narrative]

    E -- No --> G[skip Phase 2\nphase2_triggered = false]

    F --> H[mergeForensicResults\nphase1 score + phase2 score\nweighted by PHASE2_WEIGHT\nnarratives combined]

    G --> I[buildForensicResult\nphase1 score only\nphase2_triggered = false]

    H --> J[buildForensicResult\ncombined score\nphase2_triggered = true\nmanipulation_indicators list]

    I --> K([return PhotoForensicsResult])
    J --> K

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style K fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style F fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
